OpenOffice.org 1.1.2 for linux sparc is available on mirrors at
openoffice/contrib/linuxsparc

This is built from the same source as the latest official release and works
for sparc and sparc64.

Version 2.0 is scheduled for later this year but some issues are blocking
linux sparc, if you would like to help please email sparcmoz@openoffice.org

Help is also needed for testing and quality assurance.

